                <note rend="inline" type="source">124.842/127: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Minister Resident in
                        Ethiopia</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Engert</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1936-07-07T19:00:00-04:00">July 7, 1936—7 p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>298. Your 453, July 6, 7 p.m., and 454, July 6, 10 p.m. Department approves of
                    your action with understanding that other legations possessing radio stations
                    receive no more favorable treatment than that accorded to American Legation.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
